WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.950
In Manage hosting, open Backups.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.150
Find a backup from before the problem started.

3
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.757
Click Restore, and confirm.

4
00:00:11.757 --> 00:00:18.650
Any files changed since then are replaced.

5
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.269
You'll get an email when the restore is done.

6
00:00:21.269 --> 00:00:22.810
Want a copy of today first?

7
00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:24.637
Use Create backup.
